# Multi-body [case]: intermediate letrec dict followed by return expression.
# Regression test for B-515: case arm variable bindings allocated in FlatEnv.
# n is bound from the scrutinee (42), used in intermediate dict and final expression.
[call [fn [let]
  [result: [match 42
    [case [let n] n
      [doubled: [* n 2]]
      [+ doubled 1]]
    [case [let _] _ 0]]]
  [builtin-eq-int result 85]]]
=== out
Int(1)
